        "y0": 0.8101628621419271,
        "x1": 0.3411470550337648,
        "y1": 0.8215264985055635
      },
      "text": "while in a Nebula, but fleets you attack can",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.058823529411764705,
        "y0": 0.822738994251598,
        "x1": 0.3414264504426445,
        "y1": 0.8341026306152344
      },
      "text": "do so. Webs, ESGs, tractor beams, and",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
